screen.WATER_SCREEN=Water
screen.WAVING_SCREEN=Waving
screen.WAVING_SCREEN.comment=Leaves, plants and water move in the wind. Built into the pack: resource-pack waving (Vanilla Tweaks Wavy Leaves/Plants/Water) cannot run under shaders
option.WAVY_LEAVES=Wavy leaves
option.WAVY_PLANTS=Wavy plants §e[?]
option.WAVY_PLANTS.comment=Grass, flowers, crops, ferns, saplings, coral and seagrass bend from their base; vines, roots and kelp sway as a whole
option.WAVY_WATER=Wavy water §e[?]
option.WAVY_WATER.comment=The water surface rises and falls. Independent of Water > Wave size, which only ripples the reflections
option.WAVE_INDOORS=Indoor waving §e[?]
option.WAVE_INDOORS.comment=How much still moves under a roof. The wind follows the sky light each leaf, plant or water surface receives: full under open sky, fading as it gets covered. 0 = no wind indoors
option.WAVE_STRENGTH=Wave strength §e[?]
option.WAVE_STRENGTH.comment=Amplitude of all waving. Rain strengthens the wind further
option.WAVE_SPEED=Wave speed
option.WATER_BRIGHTNESS=Water brightness
option.WATER_B=Water blueness
option.WATER_A=Water opacity
option.WATER_MIN_GLINT=Glint strength §e[?]
option.WATER_MIN_GLINT.comment=Determines how much texture the water retains; moving water still keeps all texture
option.WATER_GLINT_BRIGHTNESS=Glint brightness
option.WATER_GLINT_CUTOFF=Glint cutoff
option.WATER_WAVE_SIZE=Wave size
option.WATER_WAVE_SPEED=Wave speed

